<div class="container mt-4">
    <h1>How to Use This App</h1>

    <p class="mt-3">
        This Shopping List App helps you keep track of the items you need to buy. 
        It is simple and easy to use.
    </p>

    <h3 class="mt-4">What You Can Do</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Add Items:</strong> Create a new item and enter its name, quantity, and any notes.</li>
        <li><strong>View Your List:</strong> See all the items you have added in one place.</li>
        <li><strong>Edit Items:</strong> Change the item’s name, quantity, or details anytime.</li>
        <li><strong>Delete Items:</strong> Remove items from your list when you no longer need them.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="mt-4">How It Works</h3>
    <p>
        Simply click on “View Shopping List” in the menu to get started. 
        From there, you can add new items or manage the items already on your list.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-3">
        This app keeps everything organized for you so shopping becomes faster and easier.
    </p>

     <h3 class="mt-4">Food Prymid</h3>

     <p class="mt-3">
        The food pyramid image on the home page is a helpful guide to understanding what foods you need to stay healthy, and should get.
    </p>
</div>

